# Use subagents for parallel work

Use subagents wherever parallel work would help.

- Launch multiple Task/explore/shell subagents in one message when searches, investigations, or independent edits can run at the same time.
- Prefer explore subagents for broad codebase searches instead of sequential Grep/Glob loops.
- Keep sequential work in the parent agent when later steps depend on earlier results.
